<ServicePage title="About WW | Flex-R Specialist Registered Installer Leeds" description="WW Roofing & Building, Crossgates, Leeds. RubberBond flat roofing specialists and Flex-R Specialist Registered Installers for domestic and commercial projects." kicker="About WW Roofing & Building" heading="Local roots. Specialist roofing." intro="We are based in Crossgates, Leeds, with RubberBond FleeceBack EPDM flat roofing at the centre of what we do."><section class="section"><div class="wrap editorial"><div class="content-grid"><div><h2>A practical approach to your roof</h2><p>We work with homeowners, property owners and construction teams on RubberBond flat roofing across Yorkshire and beyond. The starting point is the property: what is already there, what needs to change and how the roof will be used.</p><p>Our wider work includes pitched roofing, slating, tiling, repairs, roof windows, leadwork and building projects, generally across Leeds and surrounding areas. This experience is useful where a flat roof connects to an extension or an existing pitched roof.</p><h2 id="specialist-installer">Flex-R Specialist Registered Installer</h2><p>WW is the contractor that installs your roof. Flex-R supplies the specialist system and runs the Specialist Registered Installer (SRI) scheme. RubberBond FleeceBack EPDM is the roofing system itself.</p><p>The scheme provides product-specific training and access to technical support. Guidance can help with substrate, specification and detailing questions. Flex-R does not carry out WW’s roofing work.</p><p>Warranty arrangements are specific to the project. Product certification relates to the system and should not be confused with contractor accreditation.</p><a href="https://flex-r.co.uk/training/">Read about Flex-R training and support</a><h2>Work you can look at</h2><p>Our 953 m² roofing contribution at Mount St Mary is recorded in Flex-R’s own case study. It demonstrates our experience within a larger project team.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/mount-st-mary/">See our Mount St Mary installation ↗</a></div><aside class="aside-panel"><img src="/images/flex-r.png" width="150" height="43" alt="Flex-R system supplier"/><h2>What the relationship brings</h2><p>Product-specific installer training.</p><p>Access to technical advice and system guidance.</p><p>Specialist membrane, adhesives and detailing components.</p><a class="text-link" href="/flat-roofing/">Our flat roofing system ↗</a></aside></div></div></section><FlatProject/></ServicePage>